{"unit_id":"c-v-c-v__dsh-chat-nav#card-zh","repo":"c-v-c-v/dsh-chat-nav","commit":"e1d5ce27b66ecec762ed21d4f62ec9e4cd2deace","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-chat-nav 是一个供 DSH 网页客户端使用的会话导航插件，在聊天消息区右侧提供悬停展开的提问目录。它通过 shell.overlay 可加性界面槽位注册导航面板，按会话中可见的用户提问和插话生成条目，并以提问首行作为标签。用户可以点击条目跳到对应消息，滚动时面板会高亮当前可见消息；历史尚未全部加载时，还能从面板请求加载更早消息。适合需要在较长网页聊天记录中快速定位问题的 DSH 用户。代码未读取 API 密钥、账号或外部服务，也没有额外配置项。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:124-147","lib/client.js:161-168","lib/client.js:347-387","lib/client.js:473-477"]}
{"unit_id":"c-v-c-v__dsh-chat-nav#card-en","repo":"c-v-c-v/dsh-chat-nav","commit":"e1d5ce27b66ecec762ed21d4f62ec9e4cd2deace","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-chat-nav adds question navigation to DSH web chat through the shell.overlay slot. Its hover panel lists visible questions; clicking one jumps to its message, and scrolling highlights the current item. Users can request older history when available. It needs no API key or extra configuration.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:124-147","lib/client.js:161-168","lib/client.js:347-387","lib/client.js:473-477"]}
